**命题143.4（轮次反演与相邻间隔）。** 对 $n\ge2$，置

$$
z_n=\frac{x^2-\delta_n}{x^2-y^2\delta_n}.
$$

则分母严格为正，而且

$$
\boxed{
x^2-y^2\delta_n=\frac{x^3}{t_n}>0,\qquad
z_n=(-y)^{n-1},\qquad
n=1+\frac{\log|z_n|}{\log y}.
}
\tag{143.12}
$$

相邻轮次的不变量差满足

$$
\boxed{
|\delta_{n+1}-\delta_n|
=\frac{x^3y^{n-1}}{t_nt_{n+1}},
\qquad
x^3y^{n-1}\le|\delta_{n+1}-\delta_n|\le xy^{n-1}.
}
\tag{143.13}
$$

